    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/items/49334409",
    "excerpt": "Fastmail is fantastic, I've been a very happy customer for at least a couple years now. Masked emails have been so nice for throwaway/sketchy sites.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-09-07T03:14:46.572Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "fastmail-comm-2",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/items/49334409",
    "excerpt": "Fastmail is the service I've paid for longer than any other, without any pauses, and with the most satisfaction of any subscription... It's so gratifyingly functional and boring.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-09-07T03:14:46.572Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "fastmail-comm-3",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/items/49334409",
    "excerpt": "Same, been about 10 years now and it is the definition of 'It just works'. I do like that they are up front with how the data is handled and what that can mean for privacy.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-09-07T03:14:46.572Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "fastmail-comm-4",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/items/49334409",
    "excerpt": "As an alternative to forwarding, you can also configure Fastmail to fetch mail from (and send via) Gmail like a mail client.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-09-07T03:14:46.572Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "fastmail-comm-5",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/items/49334409",
    "excerpt": "Fastmail has an easy migration tool as well if you don't want to go the IMAP route. Now, migrating filters and rules over on the other hand...",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-09-07T03:14:46.572Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "fastmail-comm-6",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/items/33001391",
    "excerpt": "I switched from protonmail to fastmail recently. Fastmail was a ton faster and didn't randomly forget my sessions. Night and day to use. It also let me use two custom domains without paying twice, which was nice.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-09-07T03:14:46.572Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "fastmail-comm-7",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/items/33001391",
    "excerpt": "I switched my primary email to Fastmail a few months ago... Fastmail fitted the bill and seems to be working as I would expect.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-09-07T03:14:46.572Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "fastmail-comm-8",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/items/33001391",
    "excerpt": "Used FastMail as part of my big DeGoogle initiative last winter. Very happy with it. However, one consideration is that the domains they used are 'Visa-free' in terms of spam catchment - everything gets through!",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-09-07T03:14:46.572Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "fastmail-comm-9",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/items/33001391",
    "excerpt": "I contemplated the move from Google services and... went ahead and was very pleasantly surprised how easy the move to Fastmail was, with the domain managed by Cloudflare.",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-09-07T03:14:46.572Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "fastmail-comm-10",
    "tier": "community",
    "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/items/33001391",
    "excerpt": "Actually really good. I've just checked my spam folder and it's full - nothing has made it through (I'd forgotten it was a thing, much like with Gmail). disclaimer: FM customer.",
